---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const beta = 'https://gobk-checkup-beta.jimmydanol.chatgpt.site';
const frameScript = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}checkup-beta-frame.js`;
---
<Base title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta)" description="Explore debt pressure, bankruptcy discussion topics and alternatives with invented examples. Draft for review, not a filing determination.">
  <section class="section beta-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta)</h1>
      <p class="lede">Is bankruptcy worth exploring? Try invented examples to see why a consultation might help, compare alternatives and prepare useful questions. The Checkup now considers payment pressure and your main goal alongside the monthly budget.</p>
      <p class="beta-notice"><strong>Synthetic data only. Draft, not attorney-approved.</strong> Do not enter real consumer data. No signup, email or saved assessment is required. This beta does not determine bankruptcy eligibility, property protection or which debts can be discharged.</p>
      <p><a href={beta} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the beta in its own window</a></p>
      <p>Want to see why a result appears? Open <a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow">Bankruptcy Checkup Beta Workflow</a>, or test different answers and draft step arrangements in <a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow-interactive">the interactive workflow</a>. A surplus does not rule bankruptcy out; a shortfall does not prove you should file.</p>
      <iframe data-gobk-checkup-beta src={beta} title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta) synthetic-data questionnaire" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<script is:inline src={frameScript}></script>
<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .beta-notice { border-left: 4px solid var(--sage); padding: 1rem; background: var(--paper, #f7f5ef); margin-block: 1.5rem; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 1600px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; background: #f7f5ef; }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) { iframe { height: 1900px; } }
</style>
